+    // Deliberately NOT _get_wakeup_cause(false). On the light-sleep path that
+    // helper consults only software flags, and the TimeAlarm flag is set by
+    // timer_callback() dispatched with ESP_TIMER_TASK -- a separate FreeRTOS
+    // task that has not necessarily been scheduled by the time we get here.
+    // Losing that race leaves the flag clear, and because
